{"id":"wb-7-165","name":"小古城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"小古城遗址","text":"小古城遗址位于浙江省杭州市余杭区径山镇俞家堰村西南约200米处，是一座人工堆筑的大土台，面积约达35万平方米。出土遗存上至马家浜文化，下至春秋战国，尤以马桥文化最为丰富。1997年8月29日列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92039801,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92039801","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/63d737218da84396e6c832c8.jpg","title":"Xiaogucheng_Site,_2020-01-05_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xiaogucheng_Site,_2020-01-05_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/Xiaogucheng_Site%2C_2020-01-05_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​余杭小古城遗址","width":320,"height":213}}